  "content": "<h1>🛠️ 用Create的力量打造Chipped方块！</h1><p>想用<strong>Chipped</strong>方块装饰建筑，又热爱用<strong>Create</strong>实现全自动合成？这个模组让你鱼与熊掌兼得！<br><strong>现在你可以通过Create模组的机械装置制作Chipped方块了。</strong>是时候让美学也自动化了！</p><hr><h2>🔧 需求说明</h2><p>使用本模组需同时安装<strong>Create</strong>和<strong>Chipped</strong>模组。请选择对应版本：</p><h3><img src=\"https://files.minecraftforge.net/static/images/favicon-32x32.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp; Create + Forge (1.20.1 和 1.19.2)</h3><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/create_vector.svg\" alt=\"Create\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chipped/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BrayDog2010/devins-badges/ab6c523498e18dcf2d63411e7522aa3a27d0a84c/assets/cozy/requires/chipped_forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Chipped Forge\"></a></p><h3><img src=\"https://fabricmc.net/assets/favicon.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp; Create + Fabric (1.20.1 和 1.19.2)</h3><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/create-fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Create Fabric\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chipped/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/BrayDog2010/devins-badges/ab6c523498e18dcf2d63411e7522aa3a27d0a84c/assets/cozy/requires/chipped_fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Chipped Fabric\"></a></p><h3><img src=\"https://neoforged.net/img/authors/neoforged.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">&nbsp; Create + NeoForge (1.21.1 和 1.20.1) 仍需Chipped但缺少图标</h3><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/create_vector.svg\" alt=\"Create NeoForge\"></a></p><hr><h2>📦 其他下载渠道</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcrafting-recipes-for-create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p><hr><h2>📦 源码与问题反馈</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/BrayDog2010/Crafting-Recipes-For-Create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"Github\"></a></p><hr><h2>✨ 功能特色</h2><ul>\n<li>将Chipped方块无缝集成到Create模组的合成体系中</li>\n<li>兼容Forge、Fabric和NeoForge加载器</li>\n<li>支持<strong>1.20.1</strong>、<strong>1.19.2及1.21.1（仅NeoForge）</strong>版本</li>\n<li>建筑党与自动化爱好者的绝佳选择</li>\n</ul><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p>💬 \"既然能用机械工程自动生产，何必手动制作方块？\"</p>",
